        "block_2_dEtQXW": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Rich Cushion Cream Ultra Plumping Moisturizer vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Summer Fridays products are not tested on animals or contain any animal by-products.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wipdLf": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Rich Cushion Cream Ultra Plumping Moisturizer gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>Rich Cushion Cream Ultra Plumping Moisturizer is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products. <br/><br/>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_PFnEJE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Rich Cushion Cream Ultra Plumping Moisturizer non-comedogenic?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Rich Cushion Cream Ultra Plumping Moisturizer is non-comedogenic, which means it will not clog pores.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_xY79XQ": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Rich Cushion Cream Ultra Plumping Moisturizer suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Rich Cushion Cream Ultra Plumping Moisturizer is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dnfwT7": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Rich Cushion Cream Ultra Plumping Moisturizer fragrance-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Rich Cushion Cream Ultra Plumping Moisturizer is formulated without fragrance.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_reBT7t": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does the texture differ from Jet Lag Mask and Cloud Dew?",
            "content": "<p>Cloud Dew is an ultra-lightweight gel cream that delivers intense hydration without feeling heavy on the skin. Jet Lag Mask is a skin-soothing cream that has a thick texture. Rich Cushion Cream is an emollient moisturizer with a silky texture and a refreshing feel on skin.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_tkRjXU": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I wear Rich Cushion Cream under makeup?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! This formula layers beautifully under makeup and is the perfect prep step. Use it as a primer before makeup to boost hydration and glow.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        }
      },
